{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12225200","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12225200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:7:1222520001:0":{"text":"세상에... 황금의 땅이 엉망이 됐어요!","source_cn":"天啊……流金之地变得一片狼藉了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x945EE1060A2E3A5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222520002:0":{"text":"그 산더미 같은 골드와 보물들... 그리고 예쁜 병에 담겼던 배는 다 어디 간 거지?!","source_cn":"那些堆成山的金币，宝物……还有那艘漂亮的瓶中船呢？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD9AF45AB647C70E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222520003:1":{"text":"그건 제가 대답해 줄 수 있겠네요. 골드와 모아둔 보물들 모두 그 난폭한 악마가 한입에 삼켰다고요! 병 속의 배는 머리로 들이받아서 산산조각 내버렸고요!","source_cn":"我可以回答：金币和收集来的宝物，被那头野蛮的恶魔一口气...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD48B2FD9569F32C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222520004:1":{"text":"그 녀석이 난동을 피우고 나서는 추악하고 더러운 몬스터들을 남겨두고 갔어요!","source_cn":"而且那家伙大闹完，还留下这么多污浊丑陋的魔物眷属！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD46C9A2733BFB3CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222520005:1":{"text":"...삼켜? 그렇게 많은 보물이 다 들어간다고?","source_cn":"……吞了？那么多宝贝？他能吃得下？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x385DC990DF9E90E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222520006:1":{"text":"녀석은 무엇이든 먹을 수 있고, 무엇이든 먹고 싶어 해요.","source_cn":"他好像什么都能吃，而且什么都想吃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D0BFE122CCB3C15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222520007:1":{"text":"빨리 도망치지 않았으면 이 예쁜 날개도 그 악마에게 뜯겨서 씹히고 말았을 거예요! 그 눈빛... 완전 짐승의 눈이었어요.","source_cn":"要不是我逃得快，连这双美丽的翅膀都会被那头恶魔扯下来嚼...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8FC6FBB503B0049","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222520008:1":{"text":"좋아, 상황 설명은 여기까지 하고, 이제 일을 시작해야겠네요!","source_cn":"好，前情提要就到这里吧，接下来该开始干活了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86976FDE1FD6B7E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1222520008":{"text":"좋아, 상황 설명은 여기까지 하고, 이제 일을 시작해야겠네요!","source_cn":"好，前情提要就到这里吧，接下来该开始干活了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86976FDE1FD6B7E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222520009:1":{"text":"일단 이 주변을 돌아다니는 녀석들을 같이 처리해야 해요. 그다음에 다 같이 저랑 울머스 할아버지가 공들여 짠 이 예쁜 꿈을 다시 원상 복구할 수 있을 방법을 생각해 보자고요.","source_cn":"咱们得一起解决在这四周徘徊的脏东西。之后大家再一起想办...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C8C28B6583AF3DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1222520010:0":{"text":"알았어요, 타시. 맡겨만 달라고요!","source_cn":"没问题，塔西，交给我们吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E185C9E372C30B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:0:1":{"text":"응? 일?","source_cn":"啊？干活？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x89A95C99B17D4700","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"응? 일?","female":"응? 일?","variant_male_record_index":"67168","variant_female_record_index":"67169","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:24:12022523:0":{"text":"황금의 땅에 도착했다. 이곳 역시 엉망진창이 되어있을 뿐만 아니라 몬스터가 돌아다니고 있었다.","source_cn":"你们来到流金之地，发现这里不仅变得一片狼藉，还有魔物游荡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE8B11A6D8097F79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:塔西":{"text":"타시","source":"塔西","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":5}}